Title: Powys Crufts qualifier to become one of youngest ever, aged three
Date: 2025-07-13
Firsthand information: {'Speaker': [{'Speaker': 'Caitlyn', 'Text': 'I like running around with her,', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 9, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 29}}, {'Speaker': 'Lydia Mellor', 'Text': 'She is so confident generally and she works so well with the dogs. She loves the dogs,', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 5, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 96}}, {'Speaker': 'Lydia Mellor', 'Text': 'She is already an incredibly good sport,', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 10, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 39}}, {'Speaker': 'Lydia Mellor', 'Text': 'She will shake hands with the judges, she shakes hands with the winners, she always congratulates everyone.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 11, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 107}}, {'Speaker': 'Lydia Mellor', 'Text': 'I am massively proud of the sportsmanship she is showing at this age.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 12, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 67}}, {'Speaker': 'Lydia Mellor', 'Text': "It's going to keep our sport alive,", 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 14, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 35}}, {'Speaker': 'Lydia Mellor', 'Text': "We knew it's often seen as a dog beauty pageant - but that's not the way the show world works. They are our pets, they are spoilt rotten, they want for nothing - we have a great day out.", 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 15, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 156}}, {'Speaker': 'Helen Kerfoot', 'Text': 'We are delighted to see a young competitor doing so well, having qualified for Crufts already – the result of a lot of hard work and dedication.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 17, 'StartChar': 28, 'EndChar': 151}}, {'Speaker': 'Helen Kerfoot', 'Text': "Taking part in Crufts is a real achievement but it's also something that's accessible to all.", 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 18, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 87}}], 'Description': [{'Description': "A three-year-old girl is celebrating after qualifying with her Miniature Schnauzer for next year's Crufts dog show.", 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 1, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 96}}, {'Description': 'Caitlyn, who said she loved "winning" and "getting rosettes" with her eight year-old dog Zeeva, will be one of the show\'s youngest ever competitors.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 2, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 137}}, {'Description': 'The pair from Groesffordd near Brecon, Powys, qualified after being placed in the Three Counties Championship Show last month.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 3, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 119}}, {'Description': 'Caitlyn\'s mum Lydia Mellor said she was "so proud", adding: "It\'s amazing."', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 4, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 75}}, {'Description': "By three, Caitlyn was happy to show Zeeva in the ring alone which has culminated in them now qualifying for next year's Crufts - the biggest dog show of its kind in the world, according to the organisers.", 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 8, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 179}}], 'Image': [{'ID': 'image_1', 'Caption': 'A young girl in a pink and white cardigan and skirt is smiling as she leads a white Miniature Schnauzer on a lead around on the grass.  Spectators on chairs can be seen in the background.'}]}
